OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Facross the Central Belt and south with
OL,7,Frain at times. Argyll will be mainly
OL,8,Fdry this evening and overnight with
OL,9,Fclear periods across the north.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FCloudy with spells of rain,
OL,12,Falthough drier weather tending to
OL,13,Fspread south during the day. Further
OL,14,Frain spreading northeast in the
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
