OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMainly dry Thursday, further rain
OL,7,Fspreading northeast in the evening.
OL,8,FOvernight rain soon clearing on
OL,9,FFriday, then bright with a few showers
OL,10,Fin the west. Mainly dry Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
